      "node_id": "kg_doc_2",
      "node_type": "kg",
      "content": "Emma Bull (born December 13, 1954) is an American science fiction and fantasy author. Her novels include the Hugo- and Nebula-nominated \"Bone Dance\" and the urban fantasy \"War for the Oaks\". She is also known for a series of anthologies set in Liavek, a shared universe that she created with her husband Will Shetterly. As a singer, songwriter, and guitarist, she has been a member of the Minneapolis-based folk/rock bands Cats Laughing and The Flash Girls.",
      "depth": 0,
